1294051438960511", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619751_1294051442293844_8154713239817790874_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gBwpmiU-8uQQ7kNvwHU3Nyq&_nc_oc=AdoMm2mzqwFUJ2rPI5VhtBZYH3jUgZo5xk0F-KuchZSYMbq7Q681jr5wjrp110ttwRY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS8iK6Zns_PcTC-t6-MFziEQkuzm7_aFyCNCiGe9Xs9BA&oe=6AFC8B2D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image Trailer.png", "id": "965261262669942", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_965261266003275_4119045274853098971_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vuvQk4aSEEYQ7kNvwG4keiu&_nc_oc=AdqSRhuMQU8_RLQs-iPwbnaYru8SxnSWeLIKXCdhSuTTO5s3EOFqHtXpU5Cd_KGA5zQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ10y7tbw0rGDJ6OulRNTm6lWZBYwlkH2i6ia9cbrhAbg&oe=6AFC8045"}, "display_name": "A Trav\u00e9s del Iris", "keywords": ["Narrativa", "Exploraci\u00f3n", "Memoria", "Aventura", "Personal"], "long_description": "Revive tus recuerdos y descubre que cambi\u00f3 en ti.\n\nA trav\u00e9s del Iris es una experiencia narrativa que explora la memoria, la identidad y la introspecci\u00f3n emocional a trav\u00e9s del color, la narraci\u00f3n ambiental y la interacci\u00f3n.\n\nEn un espacio personal e \u00edntimo, los jugadores descubren fragmentos de la historia al interactuar con objetos cotidianos, sutiles pistas visuales y atm\u00f3sferas cambiantes. En lugar de basarse en una acci\u00f3n trepidante, la experiencia invita al descubrimiento pausado, la observaci\u00f3n y la interpretaci\u00f3n. El entorno evoluciona con cada interacci\u00f3n, transformando la forma en que el jugador percibe el espacio.\n\nCerrar los ojos con \"Blink-to-Think\" desencadena momentos de reflexi\u00f3n y sutiles transiciones narrativas, haciendo que la quietud forme parte de la progresi\u00f3n. \n\nUn juego de Sebastian Carrasco.", "short_description": "Una experiencia narrativa en VR donde la memoria, la identidad y el color construyen un viaje \u00edntimo de reflexi\u00f3n, interacci\u00f3n y descubrimiento emocional."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Game Icon.png", "id": "1607505360556230", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673625994_1607505367222896_1574350596834126161_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W1uwwNwiKc8Q7kNvwGANTW9&_nc_oc=AdqqGdrrOUYKOO_cjHvCM4WafKeo9Qtk4XVtYQGy8yGs-HWkE1uEMKhQjT7hGuavt20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQsF2KLc5-e9Q3-OJRw0ZMlHUgmzeUxyFHZlG1uJXYP8Q&oe=6AFC95DA"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1459118102347778", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_1459118105681111_1176602155369088893_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RAtrdPNa0DMQ7kNvwGd9HfC&_nc_oc=Adq9PhHd6I7YZpyTQfWXiYhzMRcuZeDCKshF3IIO_7cmMzz5kTbGrRBYLtaz2dZKBKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT8lTM2-MhJhNkycwARwL6idHTKwBtn69SLnOO5eoNt0Q&oe=6AFC6FEF"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "1327050222649759", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298137_1327050225983092_2181195551602462942_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0_kf2G6gnzMQ7kNvwH2AgU2&_nc_oc=AdqV0uCZq-WW7TiNVmGEOw1CWuRowC1b-iXV-90LJwkDw9WxmCFFIQdjZha-FQSLHXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTBKEGc3Tu2NuTwOYw0eMrmTxvtJ336BKyGdgl0GW80ug&oe=6AFC811D"}, {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "973518925187618", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_973518928520951_3852690785809695379_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ryUc