ling, and interaction.\n\nSet inside an intimate personal space, players uncover fragments of story by engaging with everyday objects, subtle visual cues, and shifting atmospheres. Rather than relying on fast-paced action, the experience invites slow discovery, observation, and interpretation. The environment evolves with every interaction, transforming the way the player perceives the space.\n\nClosing your eyes with \"Blink- to Think\" triggers  reflection moments and subtle narrative transitions, making stillness part of the progression. \n\nA game by Sebastian Carrasco.\n", "short_description": "A narrative VR experience where memory, identity, and color shape an intimate journey of reflection, interaction, and emotional discovery."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.softwareandcreativity.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sebastian Carrasco", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.softwareandcreativity.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_AR", "es_CL", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es_PE", "es_PR", "es", "es_VE"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25805899522440235"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1625212319396376"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1684770942709413"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1684770942709413